ize your revenue, follow these simple tips:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>1. Target High-CPM Countries: <\/strong>Get international viewers by using English titles, subtitles, and SEO.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>2. Choose a Profitable Niche: <\/strong>Focus on education, tech, or finance content that attracts advertisers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>3. Create Longer Videos: <\/strong>Make videos above 8 minutes to add mid-roll ads and increase total ad impressions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>4. Improve Retention &amp; Engagement: <\/strong>The more people watch and engage, the better your RPM gets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>5. Post Consistently: <\/strong>Consistency signals YouTube\u2019s algorithm that you\u2019re active \u2014 which improves ad performance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>6. Optimize SEO<\/strong>: Use searchable titles, detailed descriptions, and relevant tags.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>7. Explore Multiple Revenue Streams: <\/strong>Don\u2019t depend only on ads. Add affiliate links, sponsorships, or your own courses.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>If you\u2019re serious about building a profitable YouTube channel or learning how monetization really works, join our <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Digital Marketing Course<\/a> at WsCube Tech.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">YouTube Income per 1000 Views by Country<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Country<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average CPM (\u20b9)<\/strong><\/td><td><strong>Average RPM (\u20b9)<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>USA<\/td><td>\u20b9800 \u2013 \u20b91,200<\/td><td>\u20b9400 \u2013 \u20b9700<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>UK<\/td><td>\u20b9700 \u2013 \u20b91,000<\/td><td>\u20b9350 \u2013 \u20b9600<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Canada<\/td><td>\u20b9600 \u2013 \u20b9900<\/td><td>\u20b9300 \u2013 \u20b9500<\/td><\/tr><tr><t